    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh i see. i didnt realize it worked like that. i just thought since it's just an herb it wouldnt be that big of a deal compared to actual drugs. is there any way i could take a small amount? like maybe just a low dose or taking it at a different time of day so the warfarin still works okay?",
